        "description": "# Rapidly build your vocabulary and practice speaking without the fear of making mistakes.  \n\n✔ Learn 1,000+ words and phrases\n\n✔ Choose to learn: English, Japanese, Korean, Chinese, Spanish, German, French, Italian, Ukrainian, Russian, Greek and Arabic\n\n✔ Play in Virtual Reality, Mixed Reality, or both!\n\n{1215350876196994}\n\n✔ Stay motivated with \"Daily Goals\" and \"Learning Streaks\"\n\n✔ Practice speaking with 16 NPCs using speech recognition, preparing you for real conversations\n\n✔ Play mini-games and use the auto-revision system to lock in your learning\n\n{1098286181845532}\n\nNoun Town's unique, award-winning approach means you don't get bored and stuck as a beginner. Complete the game by bringing color back to the world and having the confidence to speak!\n\n{2860453970780280}\n",
